### Task Manager API - Test Requests

@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{base}}

###

### 2. Get All Tasks
GET {{base}}/tasks

###

### 3. Get Specific Task (ID: 1)
GET {{base}}/tasks/1

###

### 4. Create a New Task
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Express.js",
  "description": "Build a REST API with Express and Node.js"
}

###

### 5. Create Another Task
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries",
  "description": "Milk, bread, eggs, cheese"
}

###

### 6. Create Task Without Description
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Call mom"
}

###

### 7. Update Task Details (Title and Description)
PUT {{base}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Master Express.js",
  "description": "Build production-ready REST APIs with Express"
}

###

### 8. Update Task Status to Completed
PUT {{base}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

###

### 9. Update Task Status Using PATCH
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

###

### 10. Update Task Status Back to Pending
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}

###

### 11. Delete a Specific Task (ID: 1)
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/1

###

### 12. Delete All Completed Tasks
DELETE {{base}}/tasks

###

### 13. Create Multiple Tasks for Testing
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task 1",
  "description": "First test task"
}

###

POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task 2",
  "description": "Second test task"
}

###

POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Task 3",
  "description": "Third test task"
}

###

### 14. Mark Multiple Tasks as Completed
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/5/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

###

PATCH {{base}}/tasks/6/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

###

### 15. View All Remaining Tasks
GET {{base}}/tasks

###
